    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO ORGANIC BIOMATERIALS",
    "describe_ch": "培育學生充分學習並瞭解有機生醫材料的分類，進而了解並思考因應特定用途選擇適合的材料，使學生具備各式有機生醫材料開發設計及其特性評估的能力",
    "describe_eh": "This course will establish the concept of organic biomaterials classification and make materials in a appropriate application. Students will possess the ability for design and properties evaluation of organic biomaterials.",
